  "content": "\n\n<pre><span>全新超酷發電機！</span></pre>\n<p><span>歡迎在您的模組包中使用本模組。</span></p>\n<p><span>本模組提供設定選項，您可以自行調整能量輸出，不受作者預設數值限制。</span></p>\n<p><span>以下是關於面板的相關資訊：</span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">太陽能板類型</th>\n<th>最大功率輸出&nbsp; &nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">能量儲存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">進階太陽能板</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">150 J/t</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">288,000 焦耳</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合太陽能板</td>\n<td>450 J/t</td>\n<td>864,000 焦耳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">終極混合太陽能板&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">1,350 J/t</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">2,592,000 焦耳</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量子太陽能板</td>\n<td>4,050 J/t</td>\n<td>7,776,000 焦耳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">靈體太陽能板</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">12,150 J/t</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">23,328,000 焦耳</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇點太陽能板</td>\n<td>36,450 J/t</td>\n<td>69,984,000 焦耳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">吸光太陽能板&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">109,350 J/t</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">209,952,000 焦耳</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光子太陽能板</td>\n<td>328,050 J/t</td>\n<td>629,856,000 焦耳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">創造模式太陽能板</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">10,000,000 J/t</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#00f\">2,000,000,000 焦耳</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>物品：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1636/691/screenshot_1.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1636/686/2026-04-18_09.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>本模組僅需搭配 Mekanism 即可運作。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>我的其他模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-evolution\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism-Evolution</a></span></p>",
